  "description": "This left-side crisper drawer cover support is a genuine OEM replacement part designed for refrigerators. The support rail plays an essential role in holding the crisper drawer securely in place, ensuring it slides smoothly within the fridge. Over time, the support rail can wear out or become damaged, making it difficult to open or close the crisper drawer. Replacing it with this high-quality OEM part will restore full functionality to the crisper drawer and maintain the overall efficiency of your refrigerator. To install, unplug the refrigerator and remove any items from the crisper drawer. The crisper cover support is located inside the refrigerator's main compartment. Carefully remove the old support bracket and slide the new one into place, ensuring it is aligned and securely positioned. Once the support is properly installed, the crisper drawer should function smoothly again.",
